Solution:

1. Inspect the page source code and find the exposed credentials for the support account.
2. Log in using the discovered support credentials.
3. Open Developer Tools (F12) and navigate to Application → Cookiesز
4. Locate the cookie containing the role value.
5. Change the role value from support to admin.
6. Refresh the page to obtain administrative access.
7. Retrieve the flag and submit it to complete the challenge.
